ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Venga, ¡que estoy impaciente ya!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
A ver, ¿dónde están esos valientes
fantasmas de Halloween?
¡Que no os veo, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ho tutti i dolcetti che mi servono!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Rimarrò comoda a guardare
fantasmi e spiriti da casa mia!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}On voit toujours des tas d'momies
à Halloween...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hein ? Moi, peur ?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Jamais d'la vie,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}C'est juste que leurs bandelettes
ont l'air franchement cradingues.
Mais tant qu'elles restent dehors...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ahaha!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sorry, dude!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Not even a
little bit scared here!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}You're dressed like that 'cause
you're collecting {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}candy {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}too, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
We should make a game out of it!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Win, and I'll give you some candy!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}
Lose{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}and I am going to prank you
like there's no tomorrow!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Hehehe!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wenn du mich erschrecken
willst, musste früher aufstehen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Don't come near me with that face!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}I gave you some {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}candy{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} You're
supposed to stop scaring me now!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Pas un pas de plus !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:000D:}}Tu veux que
j'fasse un malaise ou quoi ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} T'as eu
ta friandise, alors du balai !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Non ti avvicinare con quella faccia!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Il dolcetto te l'ho già dato!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Falla
finita e smettila di spaventarmi!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}OK, j'avoue{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} j'ai beau prétendre le
contraire, y'a quand même un ou
deux trucs qui m'terrorisent.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Eh ouais, chuis dure à l'extérieur,
mais toute tendre à l'intérieur,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Man sieht's mir nicht an{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Aber
selbst ich hab manchmal Angst!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Unter der harten Schale versteckt
